<tr><td>Developer-led custom builds</td><td>Customer.io</td><td>Event-triggered messaging flexibility</td></tr>
<tr><td>CRM-led sales follow-up</td><td>ActiveCampaign</td><td>Automation joined to account context</td></tr>
